cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LLMDyno in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "LLMDyno: benchmark local and cloud LLMs as coding agents"
abstract: >-
  LLMDyno runs open-source coding-agent harnesses against multi-file tasks with hidden tests, on local models
  (llama.cpp, GGUF) or cloud APIs, with VRAM fit projection, sandboxed execution, spend caps, blind LLM judging and a
  results dashboard comparing correctness, code quality, speed, memory and cost.
type: software
